{"id":"pro","lemma":"про","pos":"prep","rank":173,"glosses":["about, concerning","for"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a0/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ты про нас говоришь?","en":"Do you talk about us?","words":[{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"us","l":"мы"},{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"}]},{"text":"Вы про нас говорите?","en":"Do you talk about us?","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},null,{"g":"us","l":"мы"},{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"}]},{"text":"Я знаю про твои чувства.","en":"I know about your feelings.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1264880","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},null,{"g":"your","l":"твой"},{"g":"sense, feeling","l":"чувство"}]},{"text":"Про что ты говорил?","en":"What were you talking about?","words":[null,{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"}]},{"text":"Никто не хочет про это говорить.","en":"No one wants to talk about it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1264801","words":[{"g":"nobody, no one"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},null,{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to speak, to talk"}]}]}